": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-refs", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "bd57f06", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8a933bf", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a098f76", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 28, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Konradt", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c8c05cd", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "0f877bd", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "51a9245", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · CNC obrábění", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "74b440c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Konradt", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4a0ea05", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro společnost KONRADT jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na profesionální prezentaci služeb v oblasti CNC obrábění, montáže a zpracování kovů. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní technický vzhled, přehledné představení výrobních možností společnosti a srozumitelnou prezentaci jednotlivých služeb.</p><p>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b6682cf", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "b282bd9", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "15f10d8", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "eff4006", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "df516b3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "d508498", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f612c94", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8e7bd66", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "db072b7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "038a15f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "163a670", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2f662f7", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "14af2ee", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0e46f41", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "333397a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f56f4e9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "711e0e9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Břinčil", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b3b47fc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Při realizaci webu pro firmu Břinčil jsme kladli důraz na moderní a přehledný design, snadnou orientaci návštěvníků a kvalitní prezentaci společnosti i její techniky. Nový web zároveň slouží jako podpůrná prezentace hlavní společnosti Břinčil &amp; Míka s.r.o., pro kterou jsme v minulosti rovněž realizovali kompletní online prezentaci.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1548edb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "brincil.cz", "link": {"url": "https://brincil.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "71aaea0", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-refs-more ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "66f2d99", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Další weby, e-shopy a kampaně najdete v portfoliu Yesmark.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6e22075", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Všechny reference", "link": {"url": "https://yesmark.eu/reference/?utm_source=wwwwww.cz&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wwwwww_reference&utm_content=homepage_all", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--dark ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "c48e045", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "cenik"}, "elements": [{"id": "ae8ad2f", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-price", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7fcc3f9", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-price-card ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "73798a8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cena", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9c2aa89", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "<small>Web pro apartmány</small>od 9 900 Kč", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-price-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "90a3579", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Konečná cena záleží na počtu stránek, funkcích (rezervace, e-shop, jazyky) a grafice. Nabídku vám připravíme zdarma.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9c96b3e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "438d2c7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Chci cenovou nabídku", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "e52dd73", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "9622c44", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Časté otázky – web pro apartmány", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "71cf8f5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "toggle", "settings": {"faq_schema": "yes", "tabs": [{"_id": "5b253fa", "tab_title": "Jde synchronizovat obsazenost s Bookingem a Airbnb?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano, přes iCal nebo channel manager – volné termíny se aktualizují automaticky a nehrozí dvojí rezervace.</p>"}, {"_id": "45dd154", "tab_title": "Kolik stránek potřebuje web apartmánů?", "tab_content": "<p>Typicky 6–12: úvod, stránka pro každý apartmán, ceník, rezervace, okolí a kontakt.</p>"}, {"_id": "7437c4e", "tab_title": "Jak dlouho trvá vytvoření webu – apartmány?", "tab_content": "<p>Jednodušší web bývá hotový za 2–4 týdny, rozsáhlejší s rezervacemi nebo e-shopem za 4–8 týdnů. Přesný harmonogram dostanete v nabídce.</p>"}, {"_id": "e2bb3ef", "tab_title": "Budu si web upravovat sám?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano. Stavíme na WordPressu a Elementoru – texty, ceník, fotky i nové stránky změníte sami a ukážeme vám, jak na to.</p>"}, {"_id": "4d2bca4", "tab_title": "Tvoříte weby jen v Jeseníku?", "tab_content": "<p>Sídlíme v Jeseníku, ale weby tvoříme pro klienty z celé České republiky. Spolupráce běží online, místní rádi potkáme osobně.</p>"}], "_css_classes": "ww-faq"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "004ce01", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "poptavka"}, "elements": [{"id": "173102b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "e16c38d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7f42ca4", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "c43073d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Poptávka", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9cf6759", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Chcete web pro apartmány?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "375b199", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Napište pár vět o svém podni